# Selective current review

Criterion/method: every stale input identified in predecessor global.log and
checks-initial.json is compared to its retained exact preimage and current bytes.
The successor ledger maps feature, affected criterion, historical evidence ID,
original path, preserved path and unchanged historical SHA-256. Current observation
inputs are bound independently in each affected evidence.json; entry.json preserves
the original envelopes. No old result receives a new input hash.

Observed delta classes and result:

- skill_revision.py and test_readme_skill_integration.py changed to delegate the
  exact project transition to project_revision.py. Original integration/preservation/
  visual chain still verifies original hashes. Current focused fast tests exercise
  known transitions, unknown bytes, corrupt preimages, bad scopes, registry rehash,
  downgrade, duplicate keys and symlinks. Their concrete log is in checks-pre-succession.
  These current observations succeed changed governance behavior only, not screenshots.
- sdd/project.md adds the bounded T011 preparation scope and preserves product phase,
  F0 adoption, D1/D2/D4, conditional D3/D4-deps, pending D5/D6 and acquisition limits.
  Compare predecessor before/ and current prose, not a new operational inference.
- Persistence spec adds exact succession/freeze constraints; plan/tasks/converge
  record current preparation and unresolved licenses. No AC-01..07 is changed or
  accepted; traceability's source snapshot remains an empty storage boundary.
  New license observations relate to dependencies, not persistence functionality.
- Shared documentary additions do not change normative skill criteria, source/oracle
  contracts of other features, or the operational source/dependency/configuration/
  corpus inputs of F0. The original read-only corpus/source verifier is rerun and
  all bound operational bytes match; no new GUI observation is necessary or claimed.

For every criterion listed in freshness-impact.json, the scoped documentary result
is APPROVED only for preservation of its contract across these deltas. Its existing
technical status and limitations remain unchanged; the ledger and current observation
are appended to affected criterion evidence references. Operational observations are
retained at exact historical inputs, not declared to have run against new documents.
For persistence preparation the aggregate remains INCONCLUSIVE because applicable
font terms/attribution remain unresolved. Product AC-01..07 remain UNVERIFIED.

Limitations: selective source/document review plus finite regression cases is not a
proof of all possible governance behavior, authenticity, legal clearance or product
operation. Structural freshness validates local bindings, not adequacy of the review.
The old freeze remains a historical identity; changed original paths are mapped to
preimages in the successor resource inventory, without rewriting that old manifest.
